---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
Show a sandbox's details

Usage: sbt inspect [OPTIONS] <SANDBOX>

Arguments:
  <SANDBOX>


Options:
  -D, --debug
          Print each smolvm command line

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format

          [default: table]
          [possible values: table, json, yaml]

      --json
          Same as --format json

  -h, --help
          Print help
